ftware (version 14.0; StataCorp).\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The outcome of the online risk assessment was analyzed to assess the types and frequencies of exposures\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}